power_from_god	one
merit_god_only_by_gift	one
merit_man_before_receiving	one
# "merit" is used of God in one claim and of man in another, but these are separate claims, each in its own sense; none of them changes sense across its statements.
# A1 joins the claim about the source of power to the claim about meriting from God, two different claims, so it is not a bridge.
